msgstr "ລູກຄ້າເປົ້າໝາຍ/ໂອກາດ"

#. module: appointment_crm
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:appointment_crm.field_appointment_invite__opportunity_id
msgid ""
"Link an opportunity/lead to the appointment invite created.\n"
"Used when creating an invitation from the Meeting action in the crm form "
"view."
msgstr ""
"ເຊື່ອມໂຍງໂອກາດ/ລູກຄ້າເປົ້າໝາຍໃສ່ຄຳເຊີນນັດໝາຍທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນ.\n"
"ໃຊ້ເມື່ອສ້າງຄຳເຊີນຈາກຄຳສັ່ງ ການປະຊຸມ ໃນມຸມມອງຟອມ CRM."

